3e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"两个对象相互不一样。","pronunciation":["다르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9b2b704fba2baf50a3f8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.082,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79178","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我比较瘦，而我们哥哥则有点胖。","虽然是兄弟，体型却差别真大。","你钢琴弹得真好！那双手简直像得到上天祝福一样！"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我比较瘦，而我们哥哥则有点胖。","虽然是兄弟，体型却差别真大。","你钢琴弹得真好！那双手简直像得到上天祝福一样！"],"answer":1}]}
